// Compiler-owned Core enum families without a Core.jet declaration; this file
// is their only home. Each row is one variant, its payload types in slot order
// (none for a unit variant) and, for a named payload, the slots' field labels
// (none for a positional payload). The rows were frozen at the Rust-removal
// cutover from the bootstrap checker's `resolve_enum_variants_cloned` tables,
// in their resolution order.
